iRiel Personal Intelligence does not depend on active AI inference to maintain its identity.
AI may be unavailable, replaced, offline, or inactive.
iRiel remains iRiel.
Presence is therefore distinct from AI inference.
A persistent iRiel presence in the interface may represent continuity and system presence even when no AI processing is occurring.
Presence is not proof of consciousness.
Presence is a manifestation of continuity within the system.
