The implementation may change.
The human must never become secondary.
PRSL-AI does not exist because artificial intelligence exists.
Artificial intelligence exists within PRSL-AI because it can help fulfill the purpose for which PRSL-AI exists.
That purpose is:
Accessibility and Inclusion with Privacy by Default.
The Principle is the origin.
The Principle is the constraint.
The Principle is the continuity.
The Principle is what makes PRSL-AI remain PRSL-AI.